  "$comment": "ADR-110 farming. Seeds/saplings (items) planted with Use become a Crop entity that grows through `stages` over growSeconds (1-hour day => most crops mature in 6-18 min, trees ~30-40 min) and then turns into the `becomes` resource node (crop_* nodes are oneShot: harvested once, may drop seeds). Crops (type crop) need tilled soil (Use a hoe). Watering (watering can, or rain) gives wateredMul for wateredSeconds; fertilizer gives fertilizerMul until maturity. tiles: allowed terrain ids (0 = unknown, always allowed).",
